# smoke_editor: the Development editor (one DLL per engine module, cmake/DesertModules.cmake) starts and draws its
# first frame with the third-party state each library keeps for the process shared by every module DLL
# (cmake/DesertWorkspace.cmake THIRD-PARTY PROCESS STATE): one ImGui context, one spdlog registry, one Jolt, one
# GLFW, one Optick, one EnTT type index (Common/Core/Entt.hpp). Played on the Development tree (studio_build.scn
# [smoke_dll]); the same frame on a Shipping-built editor is the base.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce
Дано state
Когда frames 60
Тогда 0_editor_ui first frame: the whole editor UI (menu bar, docked panels, viewport with the scene) drawn by one ImGui context - no panel missing, blank or drawn twice, no ImGui assert or "no current context" in editor.log
Тогда 1_one_registry editor.log: every engine line in the engine's own pattern from one logger (module DLLs and the editor alike), no line in spdlog's default "[info]" pattern, no second log file, no "logger with name already exists"
Тогда-вид 2_scene the viewport draws WP_Protocol as the base build: landscape, city, foliage, sky; entities, physics bodies and components found by every module (no empty outliner, no missing component panel)
